<HEAD>PART 4022&#x2014;BENEFITS PAYABLE IN TERMINATED SINGLE-EMPLOYER PLANS
</HEAD>
<AUTH>
<HED>Authority:</HED><PSPACE>29 U.S.C. 1302, 1322, 1322b, 1341(c)(3)(D), and 1344.
</PSPACE></AUTH>
<SOURCE>
